  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Flowering plants"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "In angiosperms the seeds are enclosed in fruits. They are divided into dicotyledons and monocotyledons. The male sex organ is the stamen, a filament with an anther in which pollen grains form after meiosis. The female sex organ is the pistil, with a swollen ovary, a style and a stigma; the ovary contains one or more ovules.",
    "kn": "ಆವೃತಬೀಜಿಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಬೀಜಗಳು ಹಣ್ಣಿನೊಳಗೆ. ದ್ವಿದಳ ಮತ್ತು ಏಕದಳ ಸಸ್ಯಗಳು. ಪುಂಕೇಸರ ತಂತು ಮತ್ತು ಪರಾಗಕೋಶ ಹೊಂದಿದೆ; ಶಲಾಕೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಅಂಡಾಶಯ, ಶಲಾಕೆಯ ಕೊಳವೆ, ಶಲಾಕಾಗ್ರ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "Seeds inside fruits"
    },
    {
     "en": "Smallest: Wolffia; tall: Eucalyptus"
    },
    {
     "en": "Stamen: filament + anther; pistil: ovary, style, stigma"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "In angiosperms the seeds are enclosed in fruits. They are divided into dicotyledons and monocotyledons. The male sex organ is the stamen, a filament with an anther in which pollen grains form after meiosis.",
    "kn": "ಆವೃತಬೀಜಿಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಬೀಜಗಳು ಹಣ್ಣಿನೊಳಗೆ. ದ್ವಿದಳ ಮತ್ತು ಏಕದಳ ಸಸ್ಯಗಳು. ಪುಂಕೇಸರ ತಂತು ಮತ್ತು ಪರಾಗಕೋಶ ಹೊಂದಿದೆ; ಶಲಾಕೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಅಂಡಾಶಯ, ಶಲಾಕೆಯ ಕೊಳವೆ, ಶಲಾಕಾಗ್ರ."
